    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "06. Other Concepts",
    "ruleNumber": "06.03",
    "summary": "A hazard roll (also called a Hazardous test) for a unit is 1 D6, failing on a 1-2; the unit then takes 1 [mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds), or 3 if every model in it is a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** model. Roll all of a unit's hazard rolls at once.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "app",
        "title": "Warhammer 40,000: The App",
        "appVersion": "2.8.0",
        "dataBuild": 981,
        "releaseDate": "2026-10-14"
      }
    ],
